    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "While appearing rather simple, the full likelihood function is complicated to work with analytically, and numerical approaches are usually employed.",
      "source_page": 876,
      "printed_page": 856,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_appendix1:p058:b8"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        143.0,
        593.0,
