    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "These updated weights are then used to obtain new estimates of the category-specific means and the variance, and this procedure is repeated until convergence. Formally, this EM approach proceeds as follows (Aitkin and Wilson 1980):",
      "source_page": 876,
      "printed_page": 856,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_appendix1:p058:b12"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        144.0,
